    "measurementTechnique": [
      "The DSM and RGB mosaic reconstructions were done using Agisoft Metashape software. The GCP locations are provided in three files corresponding to different survey periods: before August 2017 (Ar_2017_06_03.csv), in August 2017 (Ar_2017_08_14.csv), and on or after April 2024 (Ar_2018_04_26.csv). The DSM inferred from March 2024, when the ground was snow-covered, had only a limited number of GCPs (see report) and should not be used to estimate snow depth due to its limited accuracy and the very thin snowpack that year.",
      "All datasets have been re-interpolated to have consistent grid spacing, pixel resolution, and spatial coverage. Only locations within the rectangular area defined by the corners [331307 4309920; 330882 4310267; 330681 4309946; 331106 4309599] in UTM zone 13N were retained; values outside this area are set to [0 0 0] in the RGB mosaics and NaN in the DSMs."
    ],
